{"page":286,"width":1745,"height":2396,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"8.11 이진 탐색 트리","words":[{"text":"8.11","x":380,"y":198,"width":73,"height":47},{"text":"이진","x":474,"y":197,"width":84,"height":50},{"text":"탐색","x":574,"y":197,"width":81,"height":50},{"text":"트리","x":670,"y":198,"width":83,"height":49}]},{"text":"이진 탐색 트리(binary sem℃h *는 이진 트리 기반의 탐색을 위한 자료 구조이다. 담색","words":[{"text":"이진","x":381,"y":334,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"탐색","x":451,"y":335,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"트리(binary","x":521,"y":334,"width":151,"height":33},{"text":"sem℃h","x":685,"y":337,"width":88,"height":26},{"text":"*는","x":788,"y":336,"width":91,"height":31},{"text":"이진","x":893,"y":336,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"트리","x":962,"y":336,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"기반의","x":1034,"y":336,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"탐색을","x":1134,"y":334,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"위한","x":1238,"y":334,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"자료","x":1312,"y":334,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"구조이다.","x":1387,"y":331,"width":129,"height":34},{"text":"담색","x":1534,"y":330,"width":54,"height":32}]},{"text":"(seal℃h)은 가장 중요한 컴퓨터 핑공의 하나이다. 탐색은 우리의 일상생활에서 많이 시용되는데","words":[{"text":"(seal℃h)은","x":381,"y":388,"width":134,"height":31},{"text":"가장","x":525,"y":387,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"중요한","x":589,"y":387,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":682,"y":387,"width":76,"height":31},{"text":"핑공의","x":772,"y":387,"width":79,"height":33},{"text":"하나이다.","x":865,"y":389,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"탐색은","x":995,"y":389,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"우리의","x":1090,"y":388,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"일상생활에서","x":1190,"y":387,"width":171,"height":33},{"text":"많이","x":1377,"y":387,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"시용되는데","x":1448,"y":385,"width":141,"height":34}]},{"text":"전화번호부에서 전화번호를 찾거나, 사전에서 단어를 찾거나, 어떤 특정한 날에 선약이 없는가","words":[{"text":"전화번호부에서","x":381,"y":440,"width":189,"height":32},{"text":"전화번호를","x":586,"y":439,"width":134,"height":32},{"text":"찾거나,","x":731,"y"